  "$verificationNote": "A publishable status additionally requires an entry here. method=\"manual\" records the screen-reader pass the plan mandates; method=\"automated\" records a gate that stands in for it. platform-parity.mjs cannot verify a human ran anything, but it refuses to publish a claim nobody signed, and it keeps the two kinds distinct.",
